[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_5]
Cherry Family Strike

[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_5_desc]
In support of the Apple Family’s protest against the second agricultural reform, the Cherry Family announced that they would join the strike. They demanded that Ponyville immediately stop the agricultural reform. “Because cherries are not cold-resistant crops either, the Apple Family’s today is the Cherry Family’s tomorrow,” the Cherry Family said.

[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_5_o0]
Alas...

[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_5_o1]
Good!

