[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_14]
Contact with the Buffalo Tribe

[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_14_desc]
Chief Thunderhooves has given us a firm response: there was indeed a land dispute between the Buffalo Tribe and Appleloosa, but Appleloosa resolved it by offering apples in exchange for the Buffalo Tribe’s relinquishment of their claim to the land.
This was purely a business transaction, and the two sides have been cooperating for several years, establishing a deep friendship.
Therefore, if Ponyville, as a third party,
who wants to disrupt this normal business relationship,
destroy this strong friendship,
and make the Buffalo Tribe go against their old friend Appleloosa,
then the Buffalo Tribe will have no choice but to formally inform Ponyville —
pay more.

