[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_20_desc]
Recently the Apple and Pie families, who have always had a close relationship, have once again issued a joint statement: Appleloosa and Rock Farm will further deepen their cooperation and establish eternal family friendship. They also declared that this will become a model of friendship in Equestria and a blueprint for the next era of diplomatic relations.
It is obvious that the Crystal Empire is quite unhappy with this statement...

