[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_21]
Apple Pie Integration Agreement

[en.EVENT_C14_MAIN_21_desc]
The Apple and Pie families recently held a collective wedding: all the couples among the offspring of both families who have not yet dated will get married at the same time at this collective wedding.
At the wedding, the leaders of both families signed an agreement to ensure the eternal friendship of the two families. This agreement is called the “Apple Pie Integration Agreement”, which will officially merge the two families into one.
This is a historic moment.

